{"ts": "2026-08-31T23:47:52Z", "task_id": "TASK-7003B", "attempt": 1, "verdict": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "failed_tests": 2, "real_execution": true, "applied_files": 1, "feedback": [{"file": "src/data/market_data.py", "line": 15, "issue": "Both cache tests (test_cache_hit_skips_second_download, test_cache_miss_for_different_ticker) fail with TypeError in the cache interaction; the call cache.get(cache_key) does not match the Cache API shipped by TASK-7003A (likely a missing required argument such as 'default', keyword-only parameters, or a different method contract).", "remediation": "Read src/data/cache.py and invoke cache.get with its exact expected signature (e.g., pass the required default argument or use keyword arguments as defined). Re-run tests/test_market_data.py until both cache tests pass."}, {"file": "src/data/market_data.py", "line": 26, "issue": "cache.set(cache_key, serialized_data) may likewise mismatch the TASK-7003A Cache signature (e.g., a required ttl parameter or different parameter names), which would explain the TypeError raised on the cache-miss path that writes to the cache.", "remediation": "Match cache.set to the actual Cache.set definition in src/data/cache.py (supply ttl if required, correct parameter names/order). Acceptance requires tests/test_market_data.py fully green; currently 2 failures."}]}
{"ts": "2026-08-31T23:54:11Z", "task_id": "TASK-7003B", "attempt": 2, "verdict": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "failed_tests": 2, "real_execution": true, "applied_files": 1, "feedback": [{"file": "src/data/market_data.py", "line": 15, "issue": "cache.get(cache_key, default=None) raises TypeError in tests/test_market_data.py::test_cache_hit_skips_second_download and ::test_cache_miss_for_different_ticker: the Cache from TASK-7003A does not accept a 'default' keyword on get(). Plan step 16 explicitly required matching the exact get() signature discovered from src/data/cache.py.", "remediation": "Change to cached_data = cache.get(cache_key) using a plain positional key with no extra kwargs, and treat a None return value as a cache miss; verify against the actual get() signature in src/data/cache.py."}, {"file": "src/data/market_data.py", "line": 26, "issue": "cache.set(cache_key, serialized_data, ttl=3600) raises TypeError on the cache-miss write path: Cache.set from TASK-7003A accepts only (key, value) and declares no ttl parameter, so the second fetch in test_cache_miss_for_different_ticker cannot complete and cache storage never succeeds.", "remediation": "Change to cache.set(cache_key, serialized_data) with no ttl kwarg; only pass ttl if the TASK-7003A Cache signature actually declares it."}]}
